WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.400
When someone is coming into your mom's home,
shouldn't you know who they are?

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:10.300
At Caring Companions, we introduce you
to your caregiver before the first visit.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:14.600
You'll see their photo,
and a little about them.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.800
Because a familiar face
makes all the difference.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.900
But what happens when
your caregiver can't make it?

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:33.400
When plans change, we text you. You'll know who's
coming instead, and you can meet them too.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:41.900
Thoughtful care. Real communication.
Peace of mind for the whole family.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:46.000
Caring Companions.
Never a stranger at the door.
